<table border=0 width=100% cellspacing=0>
<tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
<font color=white>Hate raide with Equites Nobilis</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=192&lastnode_id=1755">Runja</a> on 2001-05-11 09:29:25</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>Meez gots dis message from Bartolomeu of Equites Nobilis.  If yooz would like ta go, pleez either email or /tell Bartolomeu by sunday (May 13).  Dere is only room fer 12 people (2 groups).  Me thinks dis will be a good raid, so sign up early!<br>
<br>
RARR!<br>
  - Runja<br>
<br>
------<br>
<br>
Greetings members of Bloodhorde,<br>
 <br>
My name is Bartolomeu, formerly of Equites Nobilis - the knoble knights of Terris-Thule.<br>
<br>
One week from tomorrow, May 16th, the Knights are planning a raid on the Plane of Hate.  I come before you requesting the aid and accompaniment of 12 of your bravest soldiers, priests, and spell casters.  We will be attempting to clear the entire plane, and depending on the numbers and morale of those involved, will stay to kill any of Innoruuk's followers that chose to return from the grave.<br>
 <br>
We will be preparing for the portal to Hate at 8pm EST, staging from the Southern Desert of Ro's wizard spire.  All those of the 47th season and higher are welcome to attend.<br>
 <br>
Thank you for your time, and may the Gods of Norrath shine upon and guide us.<br>
 <br>
Bartolomeu<br>
Illusionist of the 54th season<br>
 <br>
/ooc:<br>
To all members of Bloodhorde who have not met me, I have been a good friend of Izayo since our wee days back in Cazic Thule.  Equites Nobilis is planning this raid, to be lead by Underbrush (55th Ranger), and we are hoping to last until 11:30pm EST.  As I said, if there are enough people we will stay to farm repops. I will lead the repops group until 1:30am PST (4:30am EST) or until our army cannot maintain the plane.<br>
 <br>
Now to be more specific on our needs to make this raid work. At the moment, only one enchanter has signed up... myself.  Not that I doubt myself being able to control this alone, it would calm me 10 fold to have at least one backup.  Now as the raid is still a week away, I'm sure there will be others from EN to sign up.  Still, if you could bring 2 groups, each with a chanter and cleric, we would have an amazing force... such that even Innoruuk himself would tremble.<br>
 <br>
For those 12 individuals that attend, loot rules will be according to EN's policies.  Basically, this is a NEED before GREED policy.  As I'm sure you all know, Hate drops specific loot for specific classes, so some of those that come may not get any loot.  Rare gems (diamonds, blue diamonds) will probably be lottoed at the end of the raid.  Underbrush will go over gem drops before the event starts.  Any question concerning loot policies can be sent to me at ninerone@hotmail.com, and please visit www.exarch.net/eq if you want to see the rules stated specifically.<br>
 <br>
On a final note, there will be a designated pull team, and, most likely, a designated backup assist team.  Please, /assist MUST be used to ensure a painless victory for us all.  Pet classes must control their pets to the tooth or they will not use them at all.  Follow Underbrush's direction to the tooth. Anyone that repeatedly does "his own thing" will be translocated.  Understand that these rules are in place not just for Bloodhorde, but for Equites Nobilis and any "friends" that attend.  If we all work together and follow direction, we will emerge victorious and, as they say, we will "own" the plane of Hate.<br>
 <br>
I hope Bloodhorde and Equites Nobilis can join forces and take control of the plane, as the loot will be tremendous, as will be the amount of fun.<br>
 <br>
Again, if anyone who wishes to attend has any questions or concerns, please email me or see me in game.<br>
 <br>
Good luck to you all.<br>
 <br>
Bartolomeu</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr>


